WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Your crew is ready, but the material is not.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Every missing item costs time and puts the schedule at risk.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Send Avantia one list, photo, plan, or link.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Approve the options and help keep the crew moving.
